name 'ai-generated-design-postassessment-q7_2025'

question 'An online bookstore\'s website looks neat on a laptop, but on a phone the book images overlap and some text runs off the screen. What should the web designer do to solve this problem?'

wrong 'Add more text to push the images lower on the page'
right 'Adjust the CSS so the layout automatically resizes for smaller screens'
wrong 'Replace the book images with text-only description'
wrong 'Change the background color to make the problem less noticeable'

allow_multiple_attempts true

teacher_markdown <<MARKDOWN
Lessons 8, 12
MARKDOWN
